## Features

### Customer
- Browse and discover sports facilities near their location (geolocation-based search using Haversine formula)
- View facility details with an image carousel (up to 4 photos per facility)
- Select a court, date, and time slot with a colour-coded availability grid
- Past slots (already started or ended) are automatically disabled with Indian Standard Time (IST) awareness
- Two-phase payment flow via Razorpay (test mode)
- Real-time slot availability updates — a slot locks the moment another user books it (no page refresh needed)
- View booking history and cancel confirmed bookings (2-hour cancellation window)
- Join a waitlist for fully-booked slots and receive an email if a slot becomes available
- Receive booking confirmation email with full details

### Owner
- Register as an owner and manage multiple facilities
- Add facilities with 1–4 images, address, and automatic or manual geolocation
- Add courts per facility, choose sport type, and set per-hour pricing
- Generate time slots in bulk for any date range with configurable opening/closing hours and slot durations
- Slot generation prevents overlapping or duplicate slots
- View slot availability by date from the management panel
- Receive an email notification with customer contact details every time a booking is confirmed
- Owner analytics dashboard showing:
  - Total revenue and booking counts
  - Daily revenue trend (last 14 days) — line chart
  - Court-wise occupancy rate (next 7 days) — bar chart
  - Upcoming confirmed bookings with customer details
  - Recent booking activity
- Delete courts or entire facilities (facility deletion requires password confirmation)

### General
- Role-based access control (OWNER / CUSTOMER)
- JWT authentication with access + refresh token rotation
- Password-confirmed destructive actions
- Responsive dark-themed UI with sport-specific visual themes (football, cricket, badminton)

