## Deployment

| Layer | Platform | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Frontend | [Vercel](https://vercel.com) | Root directory: `client`, Framework: Vite |
| Backend | [Railway](https://railway.app) | Root directory: `server`, start: `npm start` |
| Database | [Neon](https://neon.tech) | Managed PostgreSQL, connect via `DATABASE_URL` |

### Required environment variables in production
- Set all variables from the [Environment Variables](#environment-variables) section in Railway and Vercel dashboards
- Set `FRONTEND_URL` in Railway to your Vercel deployment URL (required for CORS)
- Set `VITE_API_URL` in Vercel to your Railway backend URL
- Set `NODE_ENV=production` and `ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY=15m` in Railway

### Razorpay webhooks (production only)
Once deployed, register your webhook URL in the Razorpay dashboard:
```
https://your-backend.railway.app/api/webhooks/razorpay
```
Events to subscribe: `payment.captured`, `payment.failed`

