## Future Improvements

- Actual Razorpay refund API call on booking cancellation (currently marked REFUNDED in DB only)
- Push notifications (Web Push API) as an alternative to email-only waitlist alerts
- Dynamic pricing rules configurable per court and time range
- Multi-language support (Hindi, regional languages)
- Mobile app (React Native) using the existing REST API

